{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2014-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1414800000, "end_date": 1415404799, "month_true_total": 35, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:49:44 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "12811239", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043362653", "personaname": "Marsing", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/marsing/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 434, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 294, "last_played": 1731198434, "avatar": "b14c1c5ea73d60b3e506563a385c935fba4dc530"}, "language": "english", "review": "Exactly how it should be.\n\nMakes you feel like an actual space marine with epic finishing kills and great game play. \n\nTons of detail in multiplayers and is well worth your hard earned money.", "timestamp_created": 1415242822, "timestamp_updated": 1415242822, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "12803882", "author": {"steamid": "76561197997959933", "personaname": "Doc", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/emberoth/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 3918, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3206, "last_played": 1642184486, "avatar": "18268a67db264a7ceac745293d23524c4f2a272d"}, "language": "english", "review": "A game I would highly recommend for people who like Warhammer 40,000, or shooters, or both.\n\nIt's not a complicated game, it's repetative, but by all the Chaos Gods is it enjoyable. The campaign is fun and exciting, if not all that deep lore-wise. The mulitplayer has multiple game modes that are all fun to play, and there is a lot of customization options for your player character, with different armors and legions to choose from and the possibility to mix the different armor sets.\n\nThe posibility to copy the loadout of whoever kills you is also nice and a good way to get to use/try weapons you havent unlocked yet, not that I would say the character level matters a whole lot.\n\nAs a total I would probably give this game a solid 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1415203467, "timestamp_updated": 1415203467, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "12793958", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017069772", "personaname": "Necropuzo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/necropuzo/", "num_games_owned": 722, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 2068, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2003, "last_played": 1643726910, "avatar": "da82e76870077271f2216cb9ccd61fad0f455beb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game, both singleplayer and multiplayer.", "timestamp_created": 1415139013, "timestamp_updated": 1415139013, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 18, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.541210770606994629", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "12760627", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017600684", "personaname": "Pingers", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017600684/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 348, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 320, "last_played": 1421124916, "avatar": "3882746053d88904d3922c55b5799c4b3829eb21"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm not here to write a long winded, technical review.\n\nI'm simply here to state that this game is bloody amazing, if you like the WH40K Lore, or are interested in learning anything about it; Or if you even think that it looks mildly interesting, I highly, highly recommend buying this game.\n\nThis game is probably one of the best games that I have on my steam games list, and if I could find more time to play it, I would.\n\nBrilliant game, 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1415015336, "timestamp_updated": 1415015336, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 91, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.776523411273956299", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "12737948", "author": {"steamid": "76561198001654249", "personaname": "mrevilrobguy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ogrelord/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 301, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 154, "last_played": 1441607683, "avatar": "8dc8a54fdbc2bfebafd617b5459928704832793e"}, "language": "english", "review": "We sould have gotten a sequel.", "timestamp_created": 1414905342, "timestamp_updated": 1414905342, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 37, "votes_funny": 6, "weighted_vote_score": "0.659874379634857178", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}